  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "世界真旗妙-用國旗趣看世界",
    "sub_ename": "WONDERFUL WORLD – OVERLOOK THE NATIONAL FLAGS WITH ASPECTS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程透過觀察各國國旗的顏色、圖像與形狀，歸納整理出不同國家間的共通性與相異點，並探討這些顏色、圖像所代表的意義或象徵，進而能瞭解一個國家的歷史背景、地理景觀、宗教信仰、風俗文化、社會人文、物產資源…等狀況。以期培養學生能以宏觀的視野來認識世界，養成尊重與包容不同國家的歷史、文化、風土、民情、宗教的人文素養。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will overlook national flags all over the world, from observing their colors, graphics and shapes. We will summarize the similarities and differences between different countries. Furthermore, we will bring up the discussions and the meanings or symbols which are interpreted by these colors and graphics, which will help us to understand the countries’ historical background, geographical landscape, religious beliefs, customs and culture, social humanities, natural resources, etc. These will enable students to know the world from a macro perspective, and respect people from different history, culture, customs, tradition and religions, humanistic quality.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
